{"id":"wb-5-351","name":"汤阴岳飞庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"汤阴岳飞庙","text":"汤阴岳飞庙位于中国河南省安阳市汤阴县城关镇，2001年被列为第五批全国重点文物保护单位。\n汤阴岳飞庙重建于明景泰元年（1450年），现存建筑以明代为主，主要有精忠坊、山门、正殿、岳母刺字祠、孝娥祠、岳云祠、四子祠、三代祠等。整体建筑坐北朝南，南北朝109米，东西宽57.8米，占地面积6300平方米，建筑面积2100平方米。主体建筑大殿面阔五间，进深三间，单檐硬山顶，高10米。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B1%A4%E9%98%B4%E5%B2%B3%E9%A3%9E%E5%BA%99","revisionId":94072381,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94072381","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/05fed64d2401dfe24c5e8088.jpg","title":"20250831_Yue_Fei_Temple_in_Tangyin_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20250831_Yue_Fei_Temple_in_Tangyin_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/80/20250831_Yue_Fei_Temple_in_Tangyin_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​汤阴岳飞庙 精忠坊","width":320,"height":213}}